:: DeliveryManager [nobr] {"position":"1100,1200","size":"100,100"}
<<image "ui/img/jerry.png" { width: "70%" }>><br>
<<if setup.Delivery.isFirstVisit()>>
	@@.mc-thoughts; You step into the manager's office. The man behind the desk is graying all over, settled low in his chair under a body gone heavy and slack. His skin is pale and dry, the color of old paper, and his lips look rough and cracked. His eyes have faded to nothing you'd put a name to. His mouth hangs open a fraction, resting that way like he forgot to close it. He drags his gaze up the length of you and parks on your chest a bit longer than it needs to. His expression barely shifts, giving a hint of a hungry smile. You take a breath and start anyway.@@<br>
	<br>
	@@.mc-speech;Hello, my name is <<= setup.Mc.name()>>, and I'm looking for a job. Perhaps you have something suitable for me?@@<br>
	@@.notmc-speech; Jerry. <i>He sits up a fraction straighter, which is to say he no longer looks fully collapsed into the chair.</i> You're in luck. We've been short on couriers, and you've got the right energy for it. The customer-facing side. <i>He clears his throat.</i> I think you'd be an asset to the team.@@<br>

	@@.mc-speech;Thank you. I'm ready to start. What do I need to do?@@<br>

	@@.notmc-speech; Eager. <i>His eyes catch on your mouth for half a second.</i> That's what we like to see. Hours are 08:00 to 20:00, any day. I run a flexible shop here, none of the rigid stuff. You come in when you can, you take what's on the board. We take care of our people.@@<br>

	@@.mc-speech;Understood. How will I receive orders?@@<br>

	@@.notmc-speech; The computer thing handles it. Addresses comes through, item list comes through, you handle the rest. The girls — <i>he catches himself</i> — the couriers we have, they don't have any trouble cause they've gotten used to it.@@<br>

	@@.mc-speech;Got it. How much will I be paid for each order?@@<br>

	@@.notmc-speech; $<<= setup.Delivery.jobMoneySuccessed()>> a successful drop. $<<= setup.Delivery.jobMoneyFailed()>> if it goes sideways. Not life-changing money, but it adds up for someone with the right work ethic. <i>He leans back, hands behind his head, then thinks better of it and folds them on the desk.</i> A lot of people your age don't have that in them anymore. You look like you do.@@<br>

	@@.mc-speech;I'll do my best. Ready to start.@@<br>

	@@.notmc-speech; Great. <i>The chair creaks under him.</i> Door's always open. Anything you need, anything that's not clear, come find me. I'd rather you ask than guess. Doesn't have to be on the clock.@@<br>
	<br>
	@@.mc-thoughts; He didn't ask for ID or a reference. He didn't ask anything except whether I could stand to be in a room with him for ten minutes, and apparently the answer was yes. The money is real. The rest, I can work around.@@<br>
	<br>
	@@.mc-action; Now you can work as a courier.@@
	<br>
	<<run setup.Delivery.markFirstVisited()>>
<<elseif not setup.Delivery.isFirstVisit() and previous() isnot "DeliveryMap">>
	<br>
	<<if setup.Delivery.hasMetManagerEvent()>>
		@@.notmc-speech; Oh, <<= setup.Mc.name()>>, come in, don't be shy. I've always got time for you.@@
	<<else>>
		@@.notmc-speech;
		Hello, you're like umm... Susan? Milana? Doesn't matter, I'm a bit busy right now, let's talk later.
		If you forgot, you can work here from 08:00 to 20:00. Take orders and go ahead. Good luck.@@
	<</if>>
	<br>

	<<linkreplace "@@.usebtn;Ask about payment@@">>
		<<if not setup.Delivery.managerBJOnCooldown()>>
			@@.mc-speech;I wanted to talk about payment. Is there a way to increase it somehow?<br>@@
			<<if not setup.Delivery.meetsBeautyForManagerFlirt()>>
				@@.notmc-speech; Um... <i>He looked at me but quickly lowered his head and started flipping through his papers</i><br> I think you just need to work more<br>@@
				@@.mc-thoughts; I need to catch his attention somehow<br>@@
				@@.warningtext; (Req. <<statIcon setup.StatIcon.BEAUTY>> ≥ 35)@@
			<<else>>
				<<if setup.Delivery.hasMetManagerEvent()>>
					@@.notmc-speech;Of course, <<= setup.Mc.name()>>, I think you know how I can help you@@<br>
				<<else>>
					@@.notmc-speech; Hm...<br>
					<i>He looked at me and thought about something</i>. <br>
					I don't think I can do it. But I could offer some part-time work for such a beautiful girl<br><i>He smiled and adjusted his belt</i><br>@@
				<</if>>
				<<if setup.Delivery.canSeduceManager()>>
					@@.usebtn;[[Try to seduce him|SeduceManager]]@@<br>
				<<else>>@@.mc-thoughts; Is he asking me to suck him off? No fucking way!<br>@@
					@@.warningtext; (Req. <<statIcon setup.StatIcon.CORRUPTION>> ≥ 2)@@
					@@.mc-speech;No, I'd better go<br>@@
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>@@.notmc-speech; Enough for today, talk to me tomorrow@@
		<</if>>
	<</linkreplace>>

<<elseif previous() is "DeliveryMap">>
	@@.notmc-speech; Here is your hard-earned money for the shift. Not much, but it's something at least.@@ <br>
	<<include "EndShiftDelivery">>
<</if>>
<br>
<br>
@@.backbtn;[[Leave|DeliveryHub]] @@

:: SeduceManager [nobr] {"position":"1100,1300","size":"100,100"}
<<image "ui/img/jerry.png" { width: "70%" }>><br>
@@.mc-thoughts; The smell hits first. Menthol rub, scalp grease, the dry mineral edge of paper that's been touched too many times. There's an air freshener on the windowsill that gave up months ago. Under the rest of it, the medicinal note of a man who keeps tubes of things in every drawer.@@<br>
<br>
@@.mc-thoughts; Three women in two years. Zero men. You'd told yourself the streak was a preference. Then a politics. Then a fact. I guess this is how it ends.@@<br>
<br>
@@.mc-thoughts; A poltergeist had you pinned to a wall in the Owaissa house last Tuesday. The wall smelled like wet plaster, the thing on top of you didn't smell like anything, and that you could work with. Ghosts are abstract. They don't have a tongue clumbsily wrigling towards you.@@<br>
<br>
@@.mc-thoughts; Heating bill: one-hundred and forty-two dollars. Economy: shambles. The math is the math. The math has been the math since you signed the deed.@@<br>
<br>
@@.mc-thoughts; Jerry hasn't said anything. His struggling brain can't handle the currently reduced bloodflow.@@<br>
<br>
<<if setup.Delivery.canOfferHandjob()>>
	@@.usebtn;[[Offer him a handjob|DeliveryManagerHandjob]]@@<br>
<<else>>
	@@.warningtext; (Handjob req. <<statIcon setup.StatIcon.CORRUPTION>> ≥ 2)@@<br>
<</if>>
<<if setup.Delivery.canOfferBlowjob()>>
	@@.usebtn;[[Offer him a blowjob|DeliveryManagerBlowjob]]@@<br>
<<else>>
	@@.warningtext; (Blowjob req. <<statIcon setup.StatIcon.CORRUPTION>> ≥ 3, <<statIcon setup.StatIcon.BEAUTY>> ≥ 40)@@<br>
<</if>>
<<if setup.Delivery.canOfferSex()>>
	@@.usebtn;[[Offer him sex|DeliveryManagerSex]]@@<br>
<<else>>
	@@.warningtext; (Sex req. <<statIcon setup.StatIcon.CORRUPTION>> ≥ 4, <<statIcon setup.StatIcon.BEAUTY>> ≥ 45)@@<br>
<</if>>
<br>
@@.backbtn;[[Back|DeliveryManager]] @@

:: DeliveryManagerHandjob [event nobr] {"position":"1300,1300","size":"100,100"}
<<randRangeVideo "scenes/deliveryhub/manager/hj" 1 2 ".mp4">><br>
@@.notmc-speech; Smart girl. <i>Jerry unbuckles before you've finished closing the door behind you. The belt clanks against the underside of the desk.</i>@@<br>
<br>
@@.mc-thoughts; You don't look at it. You look at the wall behind the chair, at the cheap framed certificate from a delivery-industry trade group that probably folded a decade ago. There are three of them up there. Same gold-foil seal.@@<br>
<br>
@@.mc-thoughts; Your hand wraps around it. Warmer than you'd thought. You spit into your palm before you can stop yourself, a body memory from college that you didn't ask to keep.@@<br>
<br>
@@.notmc-speech; ~Ohhhh, that's it. That's a good girl. Yeah.~ <i>He keeps talking. He doesn't stop talking.</i>@@<br>
<br>
@@.mc-thoughts; You don't hear him. You count certificates. One. Two. Three. You start over.@@<br>
<br>
@@.notmc-speech; <i>He finishes on the front of his own shirt and doesn't notice.</i> Hnnh. Good girl. Take this. <i>He hands you a folded bill without looking up.</i>@@<br>
<br>
@@.mc-thoughts; You wipe your hand on the inside of your coat where it won't show. You tell yourself you'll boil the lining later. You won't.@@<br>
<br>
<<set _r to setup.Delivery.managerSceneReward('handjob')>>
<<addLust _r.lust>>
<<gainXP _r.exp _r.corruption _r.money>>
