@@.notmc-speech; <i>Jerry steers you toward the couch shoved against the back wall of the office, the one you'd taken for decorative. The cushions are flattened in the exact shape of years of Jerry. He puts a hand on the small of your back and folds you over the armrest.</i> There you go. Atta girl.@@<br>
<br>
@@.mc-thoughts; The armrest hits you across the hips. The fabric is the color of nicotine and feels like it. You plant your hands on the cushion and find the broken springs through the upholstery, two of them, one under each palm.@@<br>
<br>
@@.mc-thoughts; His hands are colder than you'd expected. You think about the woman at the bar in the city, the one who poured you that gin in October and laughed at your earrings. Her hands had been warm. You go there.@@<br>
<br>
@@.notmc-speech; ~Yeah. Yeah, you're tight.~ <i>His shirt is bunched against your shoulder blades. The menthol is the whole world.</i> You're a good girl. You know that, right?@@<br>
<br>
@@.mc-speech; ~mm~@@<br>
<br>
<<if _startLust gte 50>>
	@@.mc-thoughts; Your body decides now -- your preferences treated as no more than an off-hand suggestion. The heat starts low and climbs and your nerve endings do their assigned work without asking what you think of it.@@<br>
	<br>
	<<linkreplace "@@.mc-thoughts;~no. no, fuck, no --~@@">>
		<br>
		<<randRangeVideo "scenes/deliveryhub/manager/orgasm" 1 2 ".mp4">><br>
		@@.mc-thoughts; You bite down on the cushion to keep it quiet. It tastes like dust and old smoke and you don't care, because everything else is white noise and a long bright snap behind your eyes. Your knees buckle. The couch springs give with them. And somewhere above the ringing, Jerry is making a sound you will spend the rest of the week trying to unhear.@@<br>
		<br>
		@@.mc-thoughts; When you come back to the room, you are still folded over an armrest in a delivery-company office, and Jerry is still inside you, disgustingly self-assured. The math is unchanged.@@<br>
		<br>
